{title: Be Strong and Courageous}
{subtitle: Joshua 1:9}
{key: D#m}
{tempo: 77}
{time: 4/4}

{comment: Intro}
| [D#m] | [D#m] | [D#m] | [D#m] |
| [D#m] | [D#m] | [C#] | [D#m] |
